&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:58.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:7.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（当事業年度において株式数が増加した銘柄）&lt;/h6&gt;
